QuatiBot is an independently modified fork. Its changes include the Linux web
runtime, OpenCode V2-only integration, server-side credential encryption,
browser/VM recording tools, service removals and the QuatiBot identity.
The upstream proprietary enterprise directory is not distributed with this fork.

